  "2026-07-31T07:05:59.450Z","harness:codex","Implementation correction: get is not universally defective. A leaf get is a scalar envelope and now declares row_kind=none without jq_selector; get with requested children declares a real children collection. deps exposes nodes/edges and stats exposes object-map rows. The integration gate executes the published selector through jq for every static declaration."
  "2026-07-31T07:41:26.053Z","harness:codex","Acceptance evidence: a packed install in a fresh unrelated git repository resolved its executable inside the consumer root, emitted nested graph.nodes/graph.edges row paths, and executed the published universal jq selector over the real deps envelope."
  "2026-07-31T08:07:47.611Z","harness:codex","TDD guard evidence: the first linked PM read correctly failed closed under schema-only sandbox context. The stored test now declares tracker context explicitly; product tests were already green."
  "2026-07-31T08:10:36.633Z","harness:codex","Linked real-command discovery: graph summary output previously formed an invalid collection contract with zero row keys. The resolver now emits row_kind=none and omits jq_selector whenever the selected graph projection carries no row collection."
  "2026-07-31T08:30:58.690Z","harness:codex","Final evidence: full release gates passed through 407 source files and 6,585 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; static docstring, clone, boundary, token, SDK surface and package gates all passed. Live Sentry/telemetry gate then passed with 0 critical/high issues, 0 missing error-code rows, and 0.97% finish error rate."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T08:30:59.523Z","harness:codex",A universal row selector must resolve dot-delimited paths and must be omitted for scalar or summary envelopes; publishing a selector with no iterable row paths makes an empty result indistinguishable from a broken contract.
